# Build-time configuration for the deployed frontend.
#
# Deliberately empty. The app is served by the API process itself, so it calls
# "/api" on whatever origin it was loaded from -- which is correct both on the
# office network (http://<machine>:8000) and through the Tailscale Funnel
# (https://<machine>.<tailnet>.ts.net). One build works in both places, and
# there is no CORS preflight on every request.
#
# Set this to an absolute URL only if the app is ever hosted somewhere the API
# is not, such as Vercel. Vite bakes VITE_* values in at BUILD time, so changing
# it needs a rebuild rather than a restart.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
